{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/333287-gathering-interest-in-a-24-x-7-chat-rpg","id":333287,"title":"Gathering Interest in a 24 x 7 Chat RPG","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-07T12:50:02-08:00","id":333287,"title":"Gathering Interest in a 24 x 7 Chat RPG","content":"Hi Everyone,<br /> <br /> I will be hosting a chat game at an already existing chat site known as <a href=\"http://www.storysanctum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Story Sanctum</a>, and I am looking for your feedback! Please read the descriptions for each game below and then click the link to the Straw Poll to provide your feedback. This is my attempt to reach out ot the chat RPG community to see how receptive they are to each of my ideas. Though this poll outcome will help inform my final decision, I reserve the right to the final decision. Thanks in advance.<br /> <br /> <b>Straw Poll:</b> <a href=\"http://strawpoll.me/3136757\" target=\"_blank\">http://strawpoll.me/3136757</a><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\"><b><u>7th Sea: The Dead Tropics</u></b><br /> <b>System:</b> <i>7th Sea RPG</i><br /> <b>Setting:</b> <i>This game is set in the island colony of New Canguine the most prominent port of call in the Midnight Archipelago, and a gateway to the rest of the Dead Tropics. At the far end of Thean civilization lies the Midnight Archipelago - a tropical island chain on the edge of the Great Western Ocean. There, brave explorers chart the lost ruins of ancient civilizations, pirates carve personal empires in blood and gold, and hidden jungles hold monstrous beings unseen since the dawn of man. </i><br /> <b>What's Unique About this Game:</b> <i>It's not another World of Darkness city sandbox Chat Game. The setting is very much the look and feel of 18th Century Caribbean, through the lens of high-heroics swashbuckling adventure fiction. This game would be a trial for a unique system that would manage a more fluid way of encouraging player run adventures, leaving less time spent in character having tea, and more time spent swashbuckling and adventuring. The colony feel of New Canguine will have a political back drop as various countries of Theah vie for positions of trade and politics within the colony</i><br /> </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#408000\"><b><u>Arkham: Jazz Age Horror</u></b><br /> <b>System:</b> <i>World of Darkness: The God Machine Chronicle</i><br /> <b>Setting:</b> <i>This game is set in the roaring twenties in the fictional city of Arkham, Massachusetts. The game is heavily inspired by the works of H.P. Lovecraft, and the Call of Cthulhu role-playing game. The twenties were a time of jazz and prohibition, organized crime and speakeasies. Arkham\u2019s most notable characteristics are its Miskatonic University, it's gambrel roofs and the dark legends that have surrounded the city for centuries. Arkham: Jazz Age Horror maintains the themes of Lovecraft Mythos; mundane investigators struggling against the growing corruption of the Great Old Ones.</i><br /> <b>What's Unique About this Game:</b> <i>The Roaring Twenties are an interesting time period for a game setting. Communication was typically through early century phones, snail mail and telegraphs. Prohibition brought about an interesting dynamic with the growth of organized crime, and the existence of speakeasies. The God Machine Chronicles conditions system lends itself quite nicely to some of the reactions investigators might have when interacting with the dark mythos. I will be using a custom 5 x 5 splat for World of Darkness to make Investigators a unique splat from mortals. The personal splat will be known as Drives (The Believer, The Acquirer, The Survivor, The Duteous, and The Frightened). The social splat will be known as Systems (High Society, Academia, Mafia, Proletariat, and Vagrants). There will be miniature mechanics that are easter eggs related to the board game Arkham Horror, such as the Terror Track. </i><br /> </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4472-obeah","name":"Obeah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4472_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T14:05:10-08:00","id":333377,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:red\">Moved to Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T05:13:09-08:00","id":334135,"title":"","content":"Voted. Please keep us updated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-21T19:10:41-08:00","id":347096,"title":"","content":"I have decided to go with 7th Sea: The Dead Tropics. More can be found at Story Sanctum: <a href=\"http://storysanctum.com/wiki/index.php?title=The_Dead_Tropics\" target=\"_blank\">http://storysanctum.com/wiki/index.p...e_Dead_Tropics</a><br /> <br /> Sanctioning will begin over the Holiday Season and extend into the New Year.<br /> <br /> Thanks to all who voted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4472-obeah","name":"Obeah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4472_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}